{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/triangles/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/triangles.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Triangles — Pythagoras & Properties","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-violet-600 text-white py-3 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <div class=\"font-semibold\">Triangles</div>\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Triangle Basics</h2>\n      <div class=\"muted mt-2\">Angles in a triangle sum to 180°. Types: equilateral, isosceles, scalene. Right triangle uses Pythagoras: a² + b² = c².</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Worked Examples</h2>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-3 muted\">\n        <li>Find hypotenuse when legs 6 and 8 → c = 10.</li>\n        <li>Isosceles triangle: sides 5,5,6 → height = √(5² - 3²) = 4.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">1) Legs 9 and 12 — hypotenuse?</div>\n          <input id=\"t1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 15\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"tc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-violet-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"th1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"tfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">2) Triangle angles 50° and 60° — third angle?</div>\n          <input id=\"t2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 70\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"tc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-violet-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"th2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"tfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"triQuiz\" class=\"bg-violet-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Start Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"triModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 flex items-center justify-center z-40\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\">\n      <div id=\"triContent\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"triClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-violet-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06);} .muted{color:#6b7280}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}